    "_about": "Bundled OFFLINE CVE subset for product+version enrichment. This is a small, PINNED, illustrative feed shipped with the toolkit so enrichment works with no network and no extra runtime dependency. Replace/extend it with a full OSV or NVD mirror (same record shape) for production use. AUTHORIZED-ASSESSMENT data — safe to delete.",
